{"seq": 31, "t": 208.157, "kind": "message", "agent": "agent1", "to": "agent2", "chars": 728, "content": "agent1: pushed team/agent1 (commit 'Add repeat parameter...'). Repeat semantics: repeat usize default 1; 0 -> 'repeat must be at least 1'; empty string -> 'string is empty' (any repeat); fewer graphemes than repeat -> 'not enough characters (requested N, but string only has M)'. Helpers check_repeat(repeat) and too_few_characters(text:&str, requested) take the text, so after you trim just pass the trimmed &str to both and iterate its graphemes. I added tests in tests/suite/foundations/str.typ (string-first-and-last-repeat and 4 error tests, inserted before string-first-empty); append yours at the END to avoid conflicts. You merge and write the combined body; I will merge team/agent2 afterwards and take your resolution.", "timestamp": 1792153113.9286742, "timestamp_iso": "2026-10-16T12:18:33.928677", "message_id": 31, "send_id": 30}
